note.paragraph:
Use the simplex method to solve the following linear programming problem:$$\begin{array}{l}
      \begin{array}{llllllll}
      \text{Maximize} & {~~~~~~2x_{1}} & + & x_{2} & & & & \\
      \text{subject~to} & {~~~~ - x_{1}} & + & {2x_{2}} & \leq & {~~8} & & \\
       & {~~~~~~3x_{1}} & + & {2x_{2}} & \leq & 24 & & 
      \end{array} \\
      {\text{~and~}x_{1} \geq 0,x_{2} \geq 0.}
      \end{array}$$

statement.paragraph:
$\begin{array}{l}
      \begin{matrix}
      \text{Maximize} & {  10x_{1}} & + & {12x_{2}} & & \\
      \text{subject~to} & {~~2x_{1}} & + & {~~3x_{2}} & \leq & 36 \\
       & {~~~5x_{1}} & + & {~~4x_{2}} & \leq & 55
      \end{matrix} \\
      {\text{~and~}x_{1} \geq 0,x_{2} \geq 0.}
      \end{array}$ ﻿

$\begin{array}{l}
      \begin{matrix}
      \text{Maximize} & {  5x_{1}} & + & {4x_{2}} & & \\
      \text{subject~to} & {~~x_{1}} & + & {5x_{2}} & \leq & 70 \\
       & {~3x_{1}} & + & {2x_{2}} & \leq & 54
      \end{matrix} \\
      {\text{~and~}x_{1} \geq 0,x_{2} \geq 0.}
      \end{array}$ ﻿

$\begin{array}{l}
      \begin{array}{rrrrrr}
      \text{Maximize} & {  4x_{1}} & + & {5x_{2}} & & \\
      \text{subject~to~} & x_{1} & + & {2x_{2}} & \leq & 26 \\
       & {2x_{1}} & + & {3x_{2}} & \leq & 30 \\
       & x_{1} & + & x_{2} & \leq & 13
      \end{array} \\
      {\text{~and~}x_{1} \geq 0,x_{2} \geq 0.}
      \end{array}$ ﻿

$\begin{array}{l}
      \begin{matrix}
      \text{Minimize} & {  12x_{1}} & + & {5x_{2}} & & \\
      \text{subject~to} & {2x_{1}} & + & x_{2} & \geq & 32 \\
       & {- 3x_{1}} & + & {5x_{2}} & \leq & 30
      \end{matrix} \\
      {\text{~and~}x_{1} \geq 0,x_{2} \geq 0.}
      \end{array}$ ﻿
